# Judge7-12-2

@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-First
@pauseTrial false { timer:false }
@HideUI DebateUI
@ShowUI ControlPanel

# カットイン
@StopBgm 
@gosubCutIn Hiro
@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.EndDebate-Last

@char Hiro.Normal2,ArmR1,ArmL1,Eyes2_Normal_Closed1,Mouth2_Determined_Open1
